00:25:00.209 --> 00:25:01.077
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Maya!</font></b>

00:28:10.626 --> 00:28:12.940
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Tidak...</font></b>

00:28:54.459 --> 00:28:56.291
<b><font color="#FFFF00">Dia datang.</font></b>

